    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063530/extras/7093a434ce676b42acc742f4ff3dd064.poster.avif?t=1748918293\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063530/extras/7093a434ce676b42acc742f4ff3dd064.webm?t=1748918293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063530/extras/7093a434ce676b42acc742f4ff3dd064.mp4?t=1748918293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the mysterious Canadian detective competition! Find clues, interview suspects, and find out the truth with your teammate\u2019s unique methods! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Six Files will await you in the full game, containing convoluted puzzles from Canada\u2019s most devious masterminds. Each one takes around 2-4 hours to complete depending on your skill of deduction\u2026 But be warned, the price will increase after each File is released! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your time starts\u2026 now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yours,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Game-master</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063530/extras/39ef5faafbff14fca506a972ebadc5b4.avif?t=1748918293\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solve crimes with five unique methods</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063530/extras/2c63523a4a2e410e336f482e1e56c910.poster.avif?t=1748918293\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063530/extras/2c63523a4a2e410e336f482e1e56c910.webm?t=1748918293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063530/extras/2c63523a4a2e410e336f482e1e56c910.mp4?t=1748918293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Refute faulty theories with evidence</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063530/extras/88858343cade8c3131658edbf9fa78f1.poster.avif?t=1748918293\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063530/extras/88858343cade8c3131658edbf9fa78f1.webm?t=1748918293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063530/extras/88858343cade8c3131658edbf9fa78f1.mp4?t=1748918293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">And More!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic Storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rich Character Depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Distinctive Artwork</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive Game World</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prequel to Methods: The Detective Competition<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063530/extras/d56808f793c6942e8dc695bcc8282b3e.poster.avif?t=1748918293\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063530/extras/d56808f793c6942e8dc695bcc8282b3e.webm?t=1748918293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063530/extras/d56808f793c6942e8dc695bcc8282b3e.mp4?t=1748918293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Playing <strong>Methods: The Detective Competition</strong> first is highly recommended, but not required to understand the story.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Follow Our Twitter!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063530/extras/fe157e651496cdaa11c825b3db268d8c.avif?t=1748918293\" /></div></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063530/extras/7093a434ce676b42acc742f4ff3dd064.poster.avif?t=1748918293\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063530/extras/7093a434ce676b42acc742f4ff3dd064.webm?t=1748918293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063530/extras/7093a434ce676b42acc742f4ff3dd064.mp4?t=1748918293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the mysterious Canadian detective competition! Find clues, interview suspects, and find out the truth with your teammate\u2019s unique methods! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Six Files will await you in the full game, containing convoluted puzzles from Canada\u2019s most devious masterminds. Each one takes around 2-4 hours to complete depending on your skill of deduction\u2026 But be warned, the price will increase after each File is released! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your time starts\u2026 now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yours,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Game-master</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063530/extras/39ef5faafbff14fca506a972ebadc5b4.avif?t=1748918293\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solve crimes with five unique methods</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063530/extras/2c63523a4a2e410e336f482e1e56c910.poster.avif?t=1748918293\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063530/extras/2c63523a4a2e410e336f482e1e56c910.webm?t=1748918293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063530/extras/2c63523a4a2e410e336f482e1e56c910.mp4?t=1748918293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Refute faulty theories with evidence</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063530/extras/88858343cade8c3131658edbf9fa78f1.poster.avif?t=1748918293\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063530/extras/88858343cade8c3131658edbf9fa78f1.webm?t=1748918293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063530/extras/88858343cade8c3131658edbf9fa78f1.mp4?t=1748918293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">And More!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic Storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rich Character Depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Distinctive Artwork</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive Game World</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prequel to Methods: The Detective Competition<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063530/extras/d56808f793c6942e8dc695bcc8282b3e.poster.avif?t=1748918293\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063530/extras/d56808f793c6942e8dc695bcc8282b3e.webm?t=1748918293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063530/extras/d56808f793c6942e8dc695bcc8282b3e.mp4?t=1748918293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Playing <strong>Methods: The Detective Competition</strong> first is highly recommended, but not required to understand the story.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Follow Our Twitter!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063530/extras/fe157e651496cdaa11c825b3db268d8c.avif?t=1748918293\" /></div></p></li></ul>",
